From: UbyHost orchestrator <orchestrator@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 14:50:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Task 0004: passkeys and the one-time 2FA prompt

Optional WebAuthn passkeys (py_webauthn): add, rename and remove in Settings >
Security, log in from the login page (button first, autofill too). Passkey
login skips TOTP. One-time prompt after the first login offers a passkey first,
then an authenticator app. The e-mail link stays the recovery path.
